{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56156","headline":"还戒颂 · 杜光庭","name":"还戒颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天尊大慈悲，说戒度衆生。\n威德被幽显，果报感神灵。\n诸天来稽首，羣魔自西形。\n过去超八难，见在保千龄。\n斋福行当息，相共送虔诚。\n流梵逸云唱，飞香杂烟声。\n琼凤乘丹辇，金龙驾绿軿。\n生死皆快乐，家国悉安宁。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}